<title>FRANCE: Morocco seeks 35,000 tonnes of optional soft wheat.</title>
<headline>Morocco seeks 35,000 tonnes of optional soft wheat.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-09-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morocco will tender on September 18 to import 35,000 tonnes of optional soft wheat for shipment in the first half of October, European grain traders said on Monday.  </p>
<p>Morocco is seeking 15,000 tonnes for shipment between October 1 and October 10 to the ports of Nador and Tangiers and 20,000 tonnes between October 5 and October 15 to Agadir, they said.</p>
<p>--Paris newsroom +331 4221 5432</p>
